          <div class="archived-comment-body"><p>David, I'm just starting to use Trello, Kanban etc for virtual teams. You said you would hesitate to use Trello for teams. Up to this point I've been able to run things with a local team at my office but now everyone is virtual with most outside of my local geo. Do you have a board up (example) that would work for a small guerrilla type team of maybe 10-15 tops, or alternative PM tool recommendation?</p></div>
